      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know it's not ideal but i'm talking about just like... one small glass of white wine. nothing crazy. surely a tiny bit of alcohol won't actually kill me or anything right? i just really need to sleep tonight because i have a huge presentation tomorrow and im vibrating from stress. i feel like a little bit would just help the ambien kick in faster so i don't lie there awake for hours.",
